  "description_short": "Weeklong themed day camps at Mystic Aquarium for children entering PreK through grade 10, each group with its own classroom in the Milne Ocean Science and Conservation Center. PreK and K camps are half days from 9 am to noon, older grades run 9 am to 4 pm with trips to Bluff Point or Barn Island, and some weeks are joint camps with Mystic Seaport Museum (sailing) or Project Oceanology in Groton.",
  "indoor_outdoor": "both",
  "extended_care": true,
  "meals_included": false,
  "refund_policy_summary": "Requests must be in writing. 31 days or more before the camp week, 80% of the fee is refunded (a 20% admin fee is kept). 30 days or less before, no refund. No refund for non-attendance once camp starts or for a camper sent home for behavior; illness refunds are at the Camp Director's discretion. Full refund if the Aquarium cancels.",
  "special_needs_notes": "Campers must be fully toilet trained. Special needs campers are handled case by case.",
